---
description: DFTS React design system rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the instructions in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. In short:

- Use components from `@chris-antonio/dfts-react`; check `components.json` for exact props, defaults and allowed values.
- Style only with design tokens (`var(--...)` from `styles/tokens.css`). Never hardcode colours, spacing or radii.
- `src/components/*.jsx` are global-scope function components with no imports. Keep them that way.
- After changing components run `npm run build`, `npm test` and `npm run docs`.
